> I though we've agreed, that one needs to get rid of mandatory dependency to an optional one, and I still see a submodule section on this PR

@malfet As detailed in https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/114309/files#r1417014389, we took a look at whether we can make the submodule checkout dependent on ROCm build, but from what we could tell, the required information is not available at the time `check_submodules` is called. Also, at this point, we have reduced the size of the `triton-mathaot` submodule down to 31MB.

cc @jeffdaily
